<section class="mx-auto max-w-lg px-5 py-16"><p class="eyebrow">MULAI BERSAMA STUDIO</p><h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Buat akun pelanggan.</h1><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-neutral-600">Satu tempat untuk menyimpan brief dan memantau pesananmu.</p><form method="post" action="/register" class="mt-8 space-y-4 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-white p-6"><?= csrf_field() ?><label class="block text-sm">Nama<input class="field mt-2" name="name" required minlength="2" maxlength="100" autocomplete="name"></label><label class="block text-sm">Email<input class="field mt-2" type="email" name="email" required maxlength="190" autocomplete="email"></label><label class="block text-sm">WhatsApp <span class="text-neutral-400">(opsional)</span><input class="field mt-2" name="phone" maxlength="24" autocomplete="tel"></label><label class="block text-sm">Kata sandi<input class="field mt-2" type="password" name="password" required minlength="10" maxlength="72" autocomplete="new-password"><span class="mt-1 block text-xs text-neutral-500">Minimal 10 karakter.</span></label><button class="w-full rounded-full bg-ink py-3 text-sm font-medium text-white">Buat akun ↗</button></form></section>
